  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "ChatGPT is OpenAI's general-purpose LLM assistant for chat, reasoning, coding help, image generation, and custom GPT projects on the GPT-5.6 model family. Free tier covers everyday chat with usage limits. Go is a paid tier between Free and Plus (verify live price on chatgpt.com/pricing). Plus is $20/mo for individuals. Business is $25/seat/mo monthly or $20/seat/mo on annual billing with a 2-seat minimum. Pro starts around $100/mo for higher compute and model access. Enterprise is contact sales for admin, security, and scale.",
